},{"text":"서비스(우편집배원","x":1121,"y":1085,"width":289,"height":38},{"text":"포함)","x":1425,"y":1087,"width":81,"height":38}]},{"text":"이 비유를 계속하자면, 앤과 밀은 자기 집에서 그들의 일을 한다. 즉, 엔과 밀은 중","words":[{"text":"이","x":618,"y":1179,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"비유를","x":666,"y":1179,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"계속하자면,","x":780,"y":1177,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"앤과","x":973,"y":1177,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"밀은","x":1055,"y":1177,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"자기","x":1134,"y":1177,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"집에서","x":1217,"y":1177,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"그들의","x":1333,"y":1178,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"일을","x":1453,"y":1179,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":1534,"y":1178,"width":77,"height":37},{"text":"즉,","x":1627,"y":1180,"width":43,"height":35},{"text":"엔과","x":1688,"y":1177,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"밀은","x":1772,"y":1177,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"중","x":1847,"y":1182,"width":30,"height":36}]},{"text":"간 우편센터에서 우편물을 분류하거나 한 우편센터에서 다른 우편센터로 우편물을 운","words":[{"text":"간","x":550,"y":1240,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"우편센터에서","x":597,"y":1238,"width":200,"height":39},{"text":"우편물을","x":815,"y":1238,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"분류하거나","x":965,"y":1237,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1151,"y":1237,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"우편센터에서","x":1199,"y":1237,"width":204,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1423,"y":1238,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"우편센터로","x":1506,"y":1238,"width":176,"height":37},{"text":"우편물을","x":1697,"y":1237,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"운","x":1847,"y":1242,"width":31,"height":36}]},{"text":"반하는 작업에는 참여하지 않는다. 마찬가지로, 트랜스포트 계층 프로토콜들은 종단","words":[{"text":"반하는","x":550,"y":1300,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"작업에는","x":669,"y":1299,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"참여하지","x":823,"y":1297,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"않는다.","x":976,"y":1297,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"마찬가지로,","x":1105,"y":1296,"width":181,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1306,"y":1297,"width":174,"height":36},{"text":"계층","x":1500,"y":1298,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜들은","x":1587,"y":1298,"width":213,"height":37},{"text":"종단","x":1816,"y":1301,"width":62,"height":37}]},{"text":"시스템에 존재한다. 종단 시스템 안에서, 트랜스포트 프로토콜은 에플리게이션 프로세","words":[{"text":"시스템에","x":549,"y":1360,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"존재한다.","x":698,"y":1360,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"종단","x":856,"y":1359,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"시스템","x":939,"y":1358,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"안에서,","x":1055,"y":1357,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1180,"y":1357,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":1367,"y":1359,"width":175,"height":36},{"text":"에플리게이션","x":1556,"y":1358,"width":210,"height":38},{"text":"프로세","x":1782,"y":1362,"width":93,"height":38}]},{"text":"스에서 네트워크 경계(즉, 네트워크 계층)까지 메시지를 운반하며, 또한 반대 E2J\\言0브로","words":[{"text":"스에서","x":549,"y":1421,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크","x":665,"y":1421,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"경계(즉,","x":815,"y":1421,"width":120,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크","x":952,"y":1419,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"계층)까지","x":1101,"y":1419,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"메시지를","x":1264,"y":1419,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"운반하며,","x":1414,"y":1420,"width":149,"height":38},{"text":"또한","x":1578,"y":1420,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"반대","x":1663,"y":1420,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"E2J\\言0브로","x":1747,"y":1419,"width":131,"height":40}]},{"text":"네트워크 계층에서 애플리게이션 프로세스로 메시지를 운반한다. 그러나 트랜스포트","words":[{"text":"네트워크","x":550,"y":1483,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"계층에서","x":703,"y":1483,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"애플리게이션","x":856,"y":1482,"width":202,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스로","x":1076,"y":1482,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"메시지를","x":1265,"y":1482,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"운반한다.","x":1420,"y":1482,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":1587,"y":1482,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1711,"y":1481,"width":167,"height":38}]},{"text":"프로토콜은 메시지가 네트워크 계층 내부에서 어떻게 이동하는지는 언급하지 않는다.",